  "name": "ACTA PRO | 12 - Digital Signatures",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WORKFLOW 12 — Digital Signatures\n\nEl frontend envía las firmas (docente y representante) mediante Webhook. Valida que existan las firmas requeridas, actualiza status = signed y registra una traza de auditoría (quién firmó, fecha, hora, versión del documento) llamando al workflow 17.\n\nCONFIGURAR: almacenamiento del estado (Postgres/Sheets).",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "lg14vif95nn23kiu",
      "name": "Nota - jqnf",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "acta-pro/signatures",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "anfrg3vnom407020",
      "name": "Webhook /signatures",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const b = items[0].json.body || items[0].json;\nconst missing = [];\nif (!b.teacher_signature) missing.push('teacher_signature');\nif (!b.representative_signature) missing.push('representative_signature');\nif (!b.meeting_id) missing.push('meeting_id');\nreturn [{ json: {\n  valid: missing.length === 0,\n  missing,\n  meeting_id: b.meeting_id,\n  teacher_signature: b.teacher_signature || null,\n  representative_signature: b.representative_signature || null,\n  signed_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n  document_version: b.document_version || 1,\n}}];"
      },
      "id": "qupohmn60iraphqf",
      "name": "Validar firmas requeridas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
